    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "2dbf2ec6-57b9-3046-bf6d-e919bd93267c",
                "word": "satori",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "6c304566-199c-4756-945e-7d278031ee55",
                        "entry_id": "2dbf2ec6-57b9-3046-bf6d-e919bd93267c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "satoris"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "93af3c2d-e6c5-3055-b770-5c985f7614eb",
                        "entry_id": "2dbf2ec6-57b9-3046-bf6d-e919bd93267c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A sudden inexpressible feeling of spiritual awakening or enlightenment, the result of meditation and study."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c745f612-f595-4151-8e3c-86b33279dcbf",
                                "sense_id": "93af3c2d-e6c5-3055-b770-5c985f7614eb",
                                "text": "[B]y his ſublime underſtanding and reputed great knovvledge in divine myſteries he obtain'd, and ſtill keeps, the name and repute of a Godo, that is, a perſon bleſs'd vvith a divine and moſt accute underſtanding, vvhom they ſuppoſe to be able to find out by his Satori, or Enthuſiaſtic Speculations, ſuch miſterious truths, as are far beyond the reach of common knovvledge."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "90399dc8-9b86-42a6-ac76-0d2c7d661263",
                                "sense_id": "93af3c2d-e6c5-3055-b770-5c985f7614eb",
                                "text": "He [Darma or Bodhidharma] lived only upon vegetables, and thought this to be the higheſt degree of Holineſs, to paſs days and nights in an uninterrupted Satori, that is, a contemplation of the Divine Being."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "290c113e-32e2-4f2f-ac94-6687ed787f4f",
                                "sense_id": "93af3c2d-e6c5-3055-b770-5c985f7614eb",
                                "text": "\"Slim your hips the Zen way,\" Juliana said. \"Lose pounds through painless satori. I'm sorry, Miss Davis. I'm woolgathering.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7153e8d-3457-44ef-a053-3b9b830f28d4",
                                "sense_id": "93af3c2d-e6c5-3055-b770-5c985f7614eb",
                                "text": "It was as if [Neal] Cassady […] was in a state of satori, as totally into this very moment, Now, as a being can get."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c41755f-50b0-4c48-b72d-87d8d5f500a6",
                                "sense_id": "93af3c2d-e6c5-3055-b770-5c985f7614eb",
                                "text": "Zen teaches that we are all already enlightened, some of us simply don't choose to realize it. If we choose to embrace Satori, then we are enlightened."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a27f2083-084d-4b20-85f4-19212ae0fb44",
                                "sense_id": "93af3c2d-e6c5-3055-b770-5c985f7614eb",
                                "text": "Satori and Zen seem to have such an intimate relationship in Japan that when somebody says \"satori,\" everybody immediately associates it with Zen, and vice versa. […] For Shakyamuni, satori wasn't something peculiar only to himself. His was the satori of life inclusive of himself and all things. That is something that truly goes beyond the discrimination of our minds."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "162a9677-58f7-3e8b-a221-918a0340aa45",
                        "entry_id": "2dbf2ec6-57b9-3046-bf6d-e919bd93267c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Enlightenment, epiphany."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively",
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf4e82f9-b739-40b5-9c82-99b592d84da2",
                                "sense_id": "162a9677-58f7-3e8b-a221-918a0340aa45",
                                "text": "What happened to the Merry Band on its trip during the summer of 1964 ranged from the cosmically sublime to the ridiculous, from peak ecstasy to full-tilt satori. To say that they were merely high would do a disservice to how stoned they really were, […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d56ea313-54ef-3087-8cb5-43a85aa804b8",
                        "entry_id": "2dbf2ec6-57b9-3046-bf6d-e919bd93267c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A mutant gene of Drosophila, a genus of fruit flies, that causes homosexual behaviour in males (specifically, courtship directed to other males)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ff8044c-0856-4a3e-b1fa-bd69f15961b4",
                                "sense_id": "d56ea313-54ef-3087-8cb5-43a85aa804b8",
                                "text": "We have isolated a new Drosophila mutant, satori (sat), the males of which do not court or copulate with female flies. […] We have screened about 2000 fly lines with single P-element insertions for altered sexual behavior, yielding a mutant named satori (sat; nirvana in Japanese), the males of which do not court or copulate with females. Instead, sat males exhibit homosexual courtship."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fec3634c-7e8b-42d8-86cf-f654e4634ef0",
                                "sense_id": "d56ea313-54ef-3087-8cb5-43a85aa804b8",
                                "text": "[T]he primary site of action of the fru gene should be in the neural cells. satori,^([sic]) one of the P-insertion alleles of fru which we isolated, carried the lacZ gene of E. coli as a reporter, and β-galactosidase expression was found in a subset of brain cells including those in the antennal lobe in the satori mutant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b954593f-b1d7-4a3e-b639-e312353fd5a2",
                                "sense_id": "d56ea313-54ef-3087-8cb5-43a85aa804b8",
                                "text": "In Drosophila the satori (sat) mutants of males do not court or copulate with females but have sexual interest in males."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ccb79819-8dc8-48d8-afbf-1015903a3beb",
                        "source_entry_id": "2dbf2ec6-57b9-3046-bf6d-e919bd93267c",
                        "source_sense_description": "sudden inexpressible feeling of spiritual enlightenment or understanding",
                        "target_lang_word": "satori",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "satori",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5bac1020-387f-3429-8c7e-3149f093aa3f",
                                        "entry_id": "b244f820-7fac-355c-8d09-e1fe7d3b0e04",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Éveil spirituel brusque et complet que le disciple du bouddhisme zen cherche à réaliser par la méditation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b796999-4fb2-4fd9-a1f5-47600aeed62d",
                                                "sense_id": "5bac1020-387f-3429-8c7e-3149f093aa3f",
                                                "text": "Cet état de conscience modifié (satori) peut être considéré comme une sorte d’expérience extatique qui, à l’Ouest, serait probablement vue comme « mystique »."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "159ec985-f592-4949-8d10-a588da686e6a",
                                                "sense_id": "5bac1020-387f-3429-8c7e-3149f093aa3f",
                                                "text": "Il en rapportait un succulent fromage de l’abbaye, à la croûte crème orangée, pâte jaune paille piquée de trous d’épingle, ferme et moelleux – qui doit appartenir au rayon des saveurs oubliées, sans qu’on s’en émeuve faute de comparaison, mais envolés du même coup mille petits satoris délicieux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3582d029-d53b-4e2d-ad16-75ea19fdb9b4",
                                                "sense_id": "5bac1020-387f-3429-8c7e-3149f093aa3f",
                                                "text": "Les images prises au parc Shirogane, près du cerisier en fleur, seront les plus belles. J’ai toujours été loin du satori, mais ce que j’ai connu là peut en être la miniature : un kenshō. Une épiphanie de cet état espéré, où l’on est de plain-pied avec le présent absolu, l’extase perpétuelle, la joie exhaustive."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "27dbe8a2-b995-479a-90b0-7099b5cbeefa",
                        "source_entry_id": "2dbf2ec6-57b9-3046-bf6d-e919bd93267c",
                        "source_sense_description": "sudden inexpressible feeling of spiritual enlightenment or understanding",
                        "target_lang_word": "Satori",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Satori",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8bccb8b3-ac46-3735-8d4e-d974d64d57fa",
                                        "entry_id": "8cbcd445-22ef-36f5-9b2b-13131d567f47",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Erlebnis der Erleuchtung im Zen-Buddhismus"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9c95b50-a240-4514-a97f-c92617cf817c",
                                                "sense_id": "8bccb8b3-ac46-3735-8d4e-d974d64d57fa",
                                                "text": "„Die Bedrohung durch einen unbekannten, ungeahnten Feind, dessen Seltsamkeit und Unmittelbarkeit werden Katie entweder einknicken oder ein Satori erleben lassen, eine plötzliche Erleuchtung.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
